{"strongs": "H6845", "word": "צָפַן", "translit": "tsa.phan", "root": "צפן", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "hide, treasure up", "definition": "צָפַן verb hide, treasure up (Late Hebrew id. ; Tel Amarna ƒapânu ; set , of sun); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular ׳ צ Prov 27:16 : 2 masculine singular צָפַנְתָּ Job 10:13 +, etc.; Imperfect יִצְפֹּן Job 21:19 + Prov 2:7 Qr ( Kt רצפן ), suffix יִצְפְּנֵנִי Ps 27:5 , etc.; Participle active plural suffix צֹפְנֶיהָ Prov 27:16 passive צָפוֺן Prov 13:22 +, Ps 17:14 Kt ; feminine צְפוּנָךְ Hos 13:12 , etc.; — 1. transitive hide , with accusative of person Exod 2:2 ( E ), Josh 2:4 ( J E ), of hiding a quarrelsome woman, like hiding wind Prov 27:16 (twice in verse) (si vera 1.; compare Toy); of ׳ י 's hiding his servants (from evil) Ps 27:5 ; Ps 31:21 : = treasure up a thing, Prov 10:14 , + אִתְּךָ with thyself , in thine own keeping Prov 2:1 = Prov 7:1 , in ( ב ) the heart Job 10:13 (subject ׳ י ; of secret purposes), Ps 119:11 , compare Job 23:12 + ל person Prov 13:22 ; Song 7:14 , subject ׳ י 21:19 reserve penalty; blessings Ps 31:20 ; Prov 2:7 + מִן Job 17:4 thou [God] hast treasured up their heart away from understanding, kept it therefrom; passive, of sin Hos 13:12 (absolute; || צָרוּר ); read possibly צָפוּן for צָפוּ Job 15:22 treasured up for ( אֱלֵי ) the sword (see I. צפה ); צָפוּן = treasured, cherished place (i.e.Jerusalem) Ezek 7:22 = treasure Ps 17:14 Qr ( Kt צפינך , see צפין ), Job 20:26 (on dubious text see Bu ); plural of ׳ י 's treasured ones , his saints Ps 83:4 . 2. intransitive lie hid, lurk , absolute Ps 56:7 , with ל person Prov 1:11 ; Prov 1:18 and (of eyes of wicked) Ps 10:8 . Niph`al Perfect 3 masculine singular נִצְפֵּן Jer 16:17 be hidden from before ( מִנֶּנֶד ) ׳ י 's eyes (|| נִסְתְּרוּ ); 3 plural נִצְפְּנוּ Job 24:1 + מִשַׁדַּי stored up on the part of shadday; stored up for ( ל ) one Job 15:20 . Hiph`il hide , = Qal: Imperfect 2 masculine singular suffix תַּצְפִּנֵנִי Job 14:18 , with ב location; 3 masculine plural יצפינו Ps 56:7 Kt (but < Qr see Qal ); Infinitive construct suffix הַצְּפִינוֺ ( Ges «GKC:20h»§ 20h ) Exod 2:3 to hide him.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7191')\">BDB7191</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6845')\">H6845</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7190')\">BDB7190</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7192')\">BDB7192</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>צָפַן</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>hide, treasure up</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Tel Amarna <transliteration><highlight>ƒapânu</highlight></transliteration>; <highlight>set</highlight>, of sun); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 27:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,16)\">Prov 27:16</ref>: 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>צָפַנְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 10:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,13)\">Job 10:13</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִצְפֹּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 21:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,21,19)\">Job 21:19</ref> + <ref ref=\"Prov 2:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,7)\">Prov 2:7</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>רצפן</bdbheb>), suffix <bdbheb>יִצְפְּנֵנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 27:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,5)\">Ps 27:5</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Participle active</highlight> plural suffix <bdbheb>צֹפְנֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 27:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,16)\">Prov 27:16</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> <bdbheb>צָפוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 13:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,22)\">Prov 13:22</ref> +, <ref ref=\"Ps 17:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,14)\">Ps 17:14</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>; feminine <bdbheb>צְפוּנָךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 13:12\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,12)\">Hos 13:12</ref>, etc.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> transitive <highlight>hide</highlight>, with accusative of person <ref ref=\"Exod 2:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,2,2)\">Exod 2:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 2:4\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(6,2,4)\">Josh 2:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), of <highlight>hiding</highlight> a quarrelsome woman, like hiding wind <ref ref=\"Prov 27:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,16)\">Prov 27:16</ref> (twice in verse) (si vera 1.; compare Toy); of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s <highlight>hiding</highlight> his servants (from evil) <ref ref=\"Ps 27:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,5)\">Ps 27:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 31:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,21)\">Ps 31:21</ref>: = <highlight>treasure up</highlight> a thing, <ref ref=\"Prov 10:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,14)\">Prov 10:14</ref>, + <bdbheb>אִתְּךָ</bdbheb> <highlight>with thyself</highlight>, in thine own keeping <ref ref=\"Prov 2:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,1)\">Prov 2:1</ref> = <ref ref=\"Prov 7:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,1)\">Prov 7:1</ref>, in (<bdbheb>ב</bdbheb>) the heart <ref ref=\"Job 10:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,13)\">Job 10:13</ref> (subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>; of secret purposes), <ref ref=\"Ps 119:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,11)\">Ps 119:11</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Job 23:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,23,12)\">Job 23:12</ref> + <bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Prov 13:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,22)\">Prov 13:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 7:14\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,14)\">Song 7:14</ref>, subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> 21:19 <highlight>reserve</highlight> penalty; blessings <ref ref=\"Ps 31:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,20)\">Ps 31:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 2:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,7)\">Prov 2:7</ref> + <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 17:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,17,4)\">Job 17:4</ref> <highlight>thou</highlight> [God] <highlight>hast treasured up</highlight> their heart <highlight>away from</highlight> understanding, kept it therefrom; passive, of sin <ref ref=\"Hos 13:12\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,12)\">Hos 13:12</ref> (absolute; || <bdbheb>צָרוּר</bdbheb>); read possibly <bdbheb>צָפוּן</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>צָפוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 15:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,22)\">Job 15:22</ref> <highlight>treasured up</highlight> for (<bdbheb>אֱלֵי</bdbheb>) the sword (see I.  <bdbheb><reflink>צפה</reflink></bdbheb>); <bdbheb>צָפוּן</bdbheb> = <highlight>treasured, cherished place</highlight> (i.e.Jerusalem) <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,22)\">Ezek 7:22</ref> = <highlight>treasure</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 17:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,14)\">Ps 17:14</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>צפינך</bdbheb>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>צפין</reflink></bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Job 20:26\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,26)\">Job 20:26</ref> (on dubious text see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup>); plural of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s <highlight>treasured ones</highlight>, his saints <ref ref=\"Ps 83:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"83\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"83\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,83,4)\">Ps 83:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> intransitive <highlight>lie hid, lurk</highlight>, absolute <ref ref=\"Ps 56:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,56,7)\">Ps 56:7</ref>, with <bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Prov 1:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,11)\">Prov 1:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 1:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,18)\">Prov 1:18</ref> and (of eyes of wicked) <ref ref=\"Ps 10:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,10,8)\">Ps 10:8</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>נִצְפֵּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 16:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,16,17)\">Jer 16:17</ref> <highlight>be hidden</highlight> from before (<bdbheb>מִנֶּנֶד</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s eyes (|| <bdbheb>נִסְתְּרוּ</bdbheb>); 3 plural <bdbheb>נִצְפְּנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 24:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,1)\">Job 24:1</ref> + <bdbheb>מִשַׁדַּי</bdbheb> <highlight>stored up on the part of shadday; stored up</highlight> for (<bdbheb>ל</bdbheb>) one <ref ref=\"Job 15:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,20)\">Job 15:20</ref>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>hide</highlight>, = <b>Qal:</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 2 masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>תַּצְפִּנֵנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 14:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,18)\">Job 14:18</ref>, with <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> location; 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>יצפינו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 56:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,56,7)\">Ps 56:7</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (but &lt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> see <b>Qal</b>); <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>הַצְּפִינוֺ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:20h»§ 20h</sup>) <ref ref=\"Exod 2:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,2,3)\">Exod 2:3</ref> <highlight>to hide him.</highlight> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Prov 27:16", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 27, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Job 10:13", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 10, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Job 21:19", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 21, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Prov 2:7", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 27:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 27, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Prov 13:22", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 13, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ps 17:14", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 17, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Hos 13:12", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 13, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Exod 2:2", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Josh 2:4", "book": "JOS